     "h": 334,
     "title": "Agile »»coraExpress««",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Agile »»coraExpress««</h3> <p>»»coraExpress«« – as an autonomous mobile robot (AMR), it enables automated transport to the various systems. Alternatively, tools can also be transported using a manual pallet jack.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
