   "header": "<h3> webTMS </h3> <h2> Automation Job Management for »coraLogistic« </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The job management system for »coraLogistic« offers a user interface that permits end users to manage transport orders simply and efficiently. The user interface allows users to select the trolleys and destination machines needed to carry out the transport order. Thanks to a clear representation of the available options, users can quickly select the most suitable vehicles and destination machines for their specific requirements.</p>",
